 "text": "JUVENILE OFFICE - Washington County, Missouri\nPAY TAXES\nELECTION INFO\nTown Square & Amphitheater\nABOUT\nGOVERNMENT\nAirport\nAssessor\nCircuit Clerk\nAssociate Circuit Court Judge\nCollector\nCoroner\nCounty Commissioners\nCommission Agenda’s\nCommission Mintues\nCounty Clerk\nEmergency Management\nIndustrial Development Authority\nJuvenile Office\nProsecuting Attorney\nPublic Administrator\nRecorder of Deeds\nSheriff\nSurveyor\nTreasurer\nCOMMUNITY\n✕\nABOUT\nGOVERNMENT\nAirport\nAssessor\nCircuit Clerk\nAssociate Circuit Court Judge\nCollector\nCoroner\nCounty Commissioners\nCommission Agenda’s\nCommission Mintues\nCounty Clerk\nEmergency Management\nIndustrial Development Authority\nJuvenile Office\nProsecuting Attorney\nPublic Administrator\nRecorder of Deeds\nSheriff\nSurveyor\nTreasurer\nCOMMUNITY\nJUVENILE OFFICE\nJuvenile Office\nThe Washington County Juvenile Office in Missouri is a county agency responsible for handling cases involving minors who are accused of delinquent acts or who need court supervision due to abuse, neglect, or family-related concerns. The office investigates reports, supervises youth on probation or diversion programs, works with families and service providers, and makes recommendations to the juvenile court. Its goal is to protect community safety while promoting rehabilitation, accountability, and the well-being of children and families.\nAddress:\nWashington County Juvenile Office\n24th Judicial Circuit\n106 N Missouri St.\nPotosi, MO 63664\nOffice Hours:\n8:00am to 4:30pm\nClosed 12:00pm - 1:00pm (Lunch)\nDetention Center (24 hr. facility)\n8:00am to4:30pm M-F\nContacts:\nPhone: 573-438-5860\nAfter-Hours Phone: 573-454-2496\nFax: 573-438-7589\nCOURTHOUSE\n102 North Missouri Street\nPotosi, MO 63664\n(573) 438-6111\nEmail Us\nPrivacy / SMS Texting Privacy\nAll site contents © 2026\nWashington County is an Equal Opportunity Employer.",
